SUMMARY:AI Breakfast #55 Luzern
LOCATION:Universität Luzern\, Frohburgstrasse 3\, Lucerne
DESCRIPTION:Louis Hermann\, co-founder of DocPier\, on how accurate documen
 t processing actually has to be before it can run in production\, why a ge
 neric model on its own is not enough\, and what trustees\, insurers and ba
 nks can take from that for their own AI projects.\n\nOrganiser: Digital & 
 AI Community\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/event
 s/ai-breakfast-luzern-55/
